ing a movie in a movie theater.</br><br><span class=\"strong\">Example</span>: <span class=\"italic\">Let's see a movie tomorrow</span>.<br/> <br>You use the verb <span class=\"italic\">to watch</span> to say you see a movie at home<br/><br><span class=\"strong\">Example</span>: <span class=\"italic\">We are watching a movie. Do you want to come and watch?</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The chart shows different movie genres. Which is your favorite?</br>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Genre</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Movie Name</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Science - fiction\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Avatar</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Fantasy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Harry Potter</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Action\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Fast and Furious</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Comedy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Austin Powers</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Drama\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The Godfather</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Romance\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The Notebook</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "What type of movies do you like? "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask about movies with Wh- questions."}, {"type": "example", "content": "How is the comedy at the Delux Movie Theater?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Which film do you want to see tonight?"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Verbs with Infinitives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Some verbs are followed by the Infinitive (to + verb) of another verb."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">James</span>:  I prefer to read a book. You? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Jasmine</span>: I like to read too. I want to get a new novel."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Some of these verbs are: <span class=\"italic\"></br>want</br>prefer</br>need</br></span>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to rent"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to pay money to use something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to watch Psycho. Let's rent the DVD."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Use these words when you make movie plans."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "What do you have in mind?"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "What are you thinking you want to do?"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Let's do something different today.  </br>  <span class=\"strong\">Sara</span>: What do you have in mind?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "the first show"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the first scheduled movie of the day"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's go for the first show. It starts at 2 p.m."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type"